WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.700
I'm going to miss my train!

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:14.450
Tomoko is late!

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:20.270
Oh no! Tomoko was early today, because of her club meeting...

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.220
That's right.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:30.640
She told me yesterday that she'd be going early today.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.880
I have not been myself lately.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:40.680
Brother, Dear Brother...

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:42.960
It's true.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.710
Since that basketball practice game,

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:50.530
...I've had no peace of mind at all.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.320
Saint-Juste-sama...!

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:00.160
With life overflowing...

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.860
So radiant... Saint-Juste-sama...

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.300
She was utterly sublime!

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:13.220
And then there is Shinobu Mariko-san...

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:17.240
...openly displaying her fiery love for Kaoru-no-Kimi...!

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.850
...her love...!

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:28.190
<b>18. Into the Dream...</b>

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:35.120
Next stop is Seiran School.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.880
I want to see her.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.330
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:02.670
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.760
Prepare for departure.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.220
Let me off!

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:18.450
Perhaps one should just "let it go its own way" ...as they say...

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.010
What are your morning classes?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:26.370
Um... biology, French, ...and P.E.!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.400
I'll take care of your French...

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.700
So come along with me.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.620
Come along?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.960
These are the two sugars,

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:52.980
As shown on the board, depending on which sugar is present,

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:59.220
...DNA - deoxyribonucleic acid - and RNA - Ribonucleic Acid, are separated out.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:07.140
The bag...

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:10.800
So where are we going? <b> </b>

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:11.800
So where are we going? To take a nap.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.720
You... you're really skipping class?

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:18.370
You don't have to come...

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:22.920
Oh! I'm coming. I'm coming!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:28.580
Imagine it, Dear Brother. I'm skipping class!

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:33.470
Putting my bag in the coin locker, and playing hooky...

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:37.180
To think I'm really doing this...!

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:38.450
...I can hardly believe it.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:56.750
C'etait un jeune homme et une jeune femme dans la mise se recherche, nous paru tres propre...

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:07.350
It seems like everyone's watching me.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.590
Despite that...

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:12.400
...here I am, walking with Saint-Juste-sama!

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.270
I can bear it.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:21.340
I'll get sandwiches... and a couple of boiled eggs.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.100
Wait here, OK?

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.500
OK!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.080
Be back in a moment...

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:31.110
Mom... I'm sorry. It's just for today.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:33.480
I promise.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.210
One moment, please.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:39.980
How old are you?

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:42.730
Uh... umm... well...

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:44.910
A truant officer!

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.290
Why aren't you in school? You're a student, right?

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:49.740
Yes. <b> </b>

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.760
Yes. Which school? Is it near here?

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.500
Let me see your school I.D. please.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.310
What should I do? What should I do?

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.940
You can't show it to me? In that case...

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.380
My Brother!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.420
Nevermind your school's name, then. Just name and address.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.090
That's all I'll need.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.490
She do something wrong...?

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:17.870
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:20.820
Who are you?

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:24.980
She's with me today. Today is Founder's Day at the schools.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.940
She wants to see the Big City. <b> </b>

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.140
She wants to see the Big City. "The Big City"!

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:32.760
She's a country girl. From where all the wild pigs live.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.910
That's why I brought her here.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:36.960
Come on...

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:38.560
Uh... OK!

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.420
So that's it, then. All right.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.830
Enjoy yourselves. But be careful, OK?

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:57.580
OK.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:02.810
Having a man with you, though, it should be all right. Bye.

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:04.360
Thanks for your trouble.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:10.480
It can be really convenient, everyone mistaking me for an adult...

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:13.950
...but she thought I was a man, too!

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:19.720
Hey, now...

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:25.430
I was soared to death! Really! I was!

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:31.520
I'm sorry.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.920
I guess Nanako took today off after all...

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.250
What's up?

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.620
You look like a butterfly who's lost one of her wings!

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:10.620
Why don't you come to our basketball practice today?

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:15.740
REALLY?? I'll be there! For sure!

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:18.850
I'm inviting Rei, too...

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.400
Do you come here often?

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.610
I suppose. <b> </b>

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:25.350
I suppose. To skip your classes?

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:28.500
No, don't say that... call it a "self-proclaimed" vacation instead...

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.580
"Self-proclaimed"? Yes, that's it!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.590
But that wasn't very nice, what you said...

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:39.750
...calling me a country girl, from the land of wild pigs...!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:43.030
Just be grateful it was "pigs" instead of "bears and wolves"!

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:48.350
Well now, look at this! They managed to get here after all.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.470
Here comes my punishment!

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:59.410
My punishment!

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:02.030
What bad timing!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.970
...to run into my Brother now!

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:08.570
And he's with that same guy...!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:19.450
Hi.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.100
How have you been?

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.070
Well, well!

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:31.850
We only meet by odd coincidences, I guess!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.700
Yes, I guess so! Really!

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:50.780
Hey, I mailed you the program for our school's fair this year...

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.680
...I'd like it if you could come.

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:55.030
Gakuin University?

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:57.310
Yes! I'd love to!

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:03.300
By the way... what's happening today? Is school out today?

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.830
Well, you know... umm...

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.410
It was Rei! Rei took her out of school!

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:17.610
Live however you want.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.090
But don't get HER involved!

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:24.020
What's this? What's happening?

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.590
All right... Brother.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:36.940
"Brother"??

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.570
Excuse us. Let's go!

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:43.430
Rei!

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:48.740
"Brother"? Saint-Juste-sama's brother?

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.950
Is that it? Him?

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:14.210
Saint-Juste-sama, wait!

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.310
Who was that?

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:30.080
Why did you call him "brother"?

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.610
You didn't know?

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.200
What? Know what?

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:45.640
That... was Ichinomiya Takashi.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.870
Ichinomiya Takashi?

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:51.170
Yes. Ichinomiya Takashi.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:57.080
Ichinomiya? Is that right? From the Ichinomiya family?

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.490
And he's a friend of Henmi Takehiko-san?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.570
Yes, Ichinomiya.

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:03.380
He's Ichinomiya Fukiko's brother.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.320
He is the oldest son of the Ichinomiya family,

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:08.400
...and also... he is my brother.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:14.230
He's Saint-Juste-sama's brother? Is that it?

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:36.740
So, Ichinomiya Takashi... is Saint-Juste-sama's brother!

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:43.560
I saw him last at Saint-Juste-sama's apartment building...

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:49.170
He must have been visiting her. But...

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.370
Do you live here?

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:57.930
Uh, no... my friend is here.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:03.320
Why didn't he just tell me then?

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:08.360
Ichinomiya Takashi... Ichinomiya Fukiko...

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:11.850
...but Saint-Juste-sama's name is Asaka Rei.

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:17.640
Maybe they aren't the usual sisters and brothers.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:22.190
Maybe Saint-Juste-sama has a different mother...?

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.180
So, why are you looking so serious?

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:37.320
Stop that. Eat your sandwich.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:38.890
OK.

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.810
Did you eat the potato salad sandwich?

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:53.750
Yes.

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:57.030
It's gone bad! It's turned sour!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:00.810
Are you OK? How's your stomach? What can we do!?

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:03.160
It's no big deal.

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:05.760
What?

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:11.970
The value of a human life is no more than of an ant...

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:17.040
...and it matters little if an ant dies...

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.330
Hi, hi!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.600
Shinobu-san, are you alone? Where's Nanako?

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:43.150
You don't know, Tomoko?

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:44.490
She's absent today. <b> </b>

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:47.170
She's absent today. What! Why?

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:50.870
She's not on the absent list. Maybe she has a cold.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:54.760
Who knows. Anyway let's go sit down and eat.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:59.510
Uh... I'm eating with Kaoru-no-Kimi...

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:03.200
Oh yes, indeed you are, I see...

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:06.620
So she's out today? I'll stop by her place after school.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:13.550
What about you? <b> </b>

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:14.350
What about you? My uncle introduced me to...

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:15.830
My uncle introduced me to...

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:19.110
Oh look, it's Orihara-san!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:21.390
That game was close!

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:22.990
Is your injury OK now? <b> </b>

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:23.330
Is your injury OK now? Good luck next game!

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.670
Good luck next game!

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:26.620
Where's Rei? <b> </b>

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:27.890
Where's Rei? She's out today.

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:31.980
Someone saw her on the bus. But she didn't show up here.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.140
She's been set free!

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.310
She probably just didn't feel like coming today.

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:41.490
My Brother...

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:46.180
This morning, she and I spent hours together, alone.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:50.260
Long, quiet, peaceful hours... walking around the pond,

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:53.750
...surrounded by flowers, listening to the birds singing.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.910
Saint-Juste-sama was in her own world.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:10.600
Standing by her, I found myself gazing into her world.

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:14.100
Though it was a world I couldn't enter myself,

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:17.780
...I could see in. I alone, and no one else.

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:22.020
During a moment in time which lasted forever,

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:27.180
...I looked in with nothing to block my view. I was so happy.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.280
"Ma cherie La Poupee"

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.100
"My dear sweet doll"...

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:48.230
She said that, repeatedly, while looking at me...

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:54.490
A doll to be loved on a whim, then forgotten on a whim...?

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.700
I am not a doll...!

00:17:58.230 --> 00:17:59.970
But what does that make me, then?

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:03.260
What am I to Saint-Juste-sama?

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:07.760
No. Those answers are ones I must find within myself.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:12.320
But for now, I will just enjoy living this moment in time.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:15.530
One minute, one second, bathed in this radiant light,

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:19.090
...hearing the breezes like music in my ears.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:21.900
Please, let me never awaken from this dream.

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:38.030
What a beautiful case!

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:40.300
Yes.

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:43.050
Is it an ashtray case?

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.470
Yes...

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:48.430
It's a present. From a freshman.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:56.880
For some reason, she wants my cigarette butts.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:01.970
She'll smoke them later, she said. Bad girl...

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:10.040
I did the same thing!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:25.160
Please, give me that cigarette!

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:28.670
Give it to me please!

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.140
What are you going to do with it?

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:35.560
I... I'll smoke it. I can smoke too!

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:37.840
Give it to me!

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:41.940
Stop pretending. You can't smoke.

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.350
I can! Yes, I can smoke, too!

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:47.600
No way.

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:50.690
Yes I can!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:55.590
Are you sure?

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:01.670
OK then. I'll show you how to smoke. The REAL way!

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.080
Saint-Juste-sama! What's...

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.620
Do it! Inhale!

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.320
Stop...

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:11.130
Inhale deeply! Do it!

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:47.460
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:50.270
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:53.760
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:22.690
Are you all right?

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:28.420
Her smiling lips, her hair like threads of silk...

00:22:29.100 --> 00:22:32.520
Is she an angel ...or the devil!??

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:35.060
Now you understand.

00:22:35.680 --> 00:22:39.840
Don't smoke. It doesn't suit you.

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:46.670
I want you staying just as you are... until the end of time.

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:49.680
Brother!

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:54.090
My heart trusts in her...!

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:59.060
...this woman of tenderness and gentle words.

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:01.710
My Brother...

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:07.140
I haven't the will to think this is just a devil's sweet talk.

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:10.870
I...

00:23:11.300 --> 00:23:12.230
Mmm?

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:15.930
I...

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:19.990
I love you!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:02.380 --> 00:25:04.390
Preview

00:25:04.390 --> 00:25:09.210
Nanako can only guess what Saint-Juste feels for her.

00:25:10.040 --> 00:25:14.060
Sensing Nanako's anxiety, Kaoru confides in her.

00:25:15.030 --> 00:25:19.180
Then, Nanako discovers Kaoru-no-Kimi's secret past....

00:25:20.020 --> 00:25:21.020
Next episode: <b> </b>

00:25:21.020 --> 00:25:22.560
Next episode: <b>The Utakata Game</b>

00:25:22.560 --> 00:25:24.370
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:24.390 --> 00:25:27.390
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
